insert  into `hr_notesheet`(`id`,`date`,`number`,`priority_type`,`subject`,`description`,`author`,`created`,`modified`,`status`,`employee`) values 
(1,'2024-06-04',1,1,'Seeking kind approval for disposal of POS machines which was lying idle at the Philately Store ','<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This is to submit that as per RAA memo the company has procured the Point of Sales (POS) machines at quoted amount of Nu. 421,395.00 in line with order number PRO/192 dated 21.11.2018 which has been lying idle for more than 5 years.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Actually, according to Note sheet no. 5166 dated August 22, 2018, the Philately division aimed to use barcodes generated from POS equipment to track the sale record and integrate with the tally system to enhance the internal control mechanism based on the recommendation of the financial expert.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">However, due to the expert being non-nationality and the imposition of a six-month cooling-off period by immigration policy, the expert was forced to leave the country and ultimately decided to resign. Later due to Covid taking place globally, the management was unable to put in use of those POS machines.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Now, the Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP) will be replaced the existing tally system.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Therefore, the Procurement Unit along with the Marketing Expert will explore the market for the disposal of POS machines in order to make some financial recovery.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Submitted for kind approval, please </span></p>',139,'2024-06-04 16:09:34','2024-06-05 10:36:49',8,20),
(2,'2024-06-05',2,2,'Submission for Approval of Repair Bill – M/S UT Enterprise, Thimph','<p>This is&nbsp; to submit the bill amounting to Nu. 3800.00 (Ngultrum Three Thousand Eight Hundred only) as per Invoice No. 1074 dated 04-June-2024. This bill pertains to the costs incurred for repairing the printer at Lhamozingkha PO, as carried out by M/S UT Enterprise, Thimphu</p>\r\n<p>The cost incurred to be adjusted from the approved budget head \"Maintenance of Equipment\" allocated under the ICT Division for the current fiscal year 2024.</p>\r\n<p>Therefore, I kindly seek your approval for the same, as per the attached bill.</p>',124,'2024-06-05 09:37:40','2024-06-05 12:44:44',8,133),
(3,'2024-06-05',3,1,'Air conveyance payment to Japan Airlines for M/O. May 2024','<p>This is to submit to the management that the EMS bags sent to various destinations from Bhutan beyond Bangkok has been carried by the following airlines with the following claims:</p>\r\n<p>Airline: Japan Airlines Company Ltd.</p>\r\n<p>Month: May 2024</p>\r\n<p>Amount(SDR): 16,480.00 equivalent to USD 21,851.32 (Exchange @ 1.325930)</p>\r\n<p>Therefore, a total USD 21,851.32 (Twenty One Thousand Eight Hundred Fifty One and Cents Three Two) may only be approved for the payment to M/s Japan Airlines Company Ltd. The budget for the same is kept provision under four regions (IMR unit) for the financial year 2024.</p>\r\n<p>The sanctioned net amount in USD may be paid to the above carriers after deducting the bank charges. Therefore, the same has been submitted for management\'s approval to release the payment. The verified invoice is attached for your kind referances.&nbsp;</p>',156,'2024-06-05 12:07:57','2024-06-05 16:45:11',8,96),
(4,'2024-06-05',4,1,'Approval for spot quotation of scrap from labor camp','<p>Following the completion of the dismantling of the old cement store and the labour camps. The field team would like to seek the approval of the management for the spot quotation of the following material for disposal :&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;1. CGI sheets of various sizes (6 ft to 12 ft), 97 pieces in total.</p>',135,'2024-06-05 15:17:57','2024-06-11 14:52:59',8,98),
(5,'2024-06-06',5,1,'Seeking kind approval for contract renewal of OTIS elevator maintenance at G+4 building for annual servicing.','<p>This is to submit that our annual servicing agreement with OTIS Company has expired on&nbsp;<strong>31<sup>st</sup> May&nbsp;</strong><strong>2024</strong>. Despite of repeated remainders to OTIS Company we received the contract renewal letter only on&nbsp;6<sup>th</sup> June 2024.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;In this regard we officially discussed with OTIS service engineer and agreed verbally to renew the contract from&nbsp;<strong>1<sup>st</sup>&nbsp;June</strong>&nbsp;<strong>2024 till 31<sup>st</sup> May 2025 </strong>with the discounted rate of Nu.&nbsp;<strong>72,600 </strong>per annually.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Since OTIS Company is our esteemed customer for elevator maintenance at G+4 building, we have no any objection regarding their timely services until today.</p>\r\n<p>Therefore, under your kind consideration and authority, we would like to seek a kind approval for sanction of Nu.&nbsp;<strong>72,600 </strong>(negotiated rate) for immediate contract renewal of elevator maintenance at G+4 building so that it will be reliable for tenants to access&nbsp;&nbsp;within the premises at the earliest. Additionally, we can also meet our expectations and continues this relationship in time ahead and make it stronger and quality services. All the required documents are enclosed herewith in ERP for further reference and record la.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;The Budget shall be used under &ldquo;maintenance of building&rdquo; kept under Phuntsholing GPO for the year 2023.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;Submitted for kind approval please.</p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>',211,'2024-06-06 14:54:41','2024-06-07 14:12:53',8,75),
(6,'2024-06-07',6,1,'Seeking kind approval for release of payment for completion of roofing work of Thimphu GPO building ','<p dir=\"ltr\">Submitted herewith is the invoice number 416 dated June 6, 2024 of total amounting to Nu. 701,570.67 (Ngultrum Seven Hundred One Thousand Five Seventy and Sixty Seven chhetrum) only, for the completion of roofing work.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The cost shall be utilized from the budget head spill over budget &ldquo;HQ roofing and rainwater down pipe\".&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Therefore, seeking kind approval for release of payment.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The handing taking will be done looking at the good day (zakar)&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Submitted please.</p>',NULL,'2024-06-07 15:08:54','2024-06-07 15:08:54',2,NULL),
(7,'2024-06-07',7,1,'seeking kind approval for release of payment for completion of roofing work of Thimphu GPO building','<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Submitted herewith is the invoice number 416 dated June 6, 2024 of total amounting to Nu. 701,570.67 (Ngultrum Seven Hundred One Thousand Five Seventy and Sixty Seven chhetrum) only, for the completion of roofing work.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The cost shall be utilized from the budget head spill over budget </span><strong>&ldquo;HQ roofing and rainwater down pipe\".&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Therefore, seeking kind approval for release of payment.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The handing taking will be done looking at the good day (zakar)&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Submitted please.</span></p>',139,'2024-06-07 15:11:48','2024-06-11 14:54:26',8,20),
(8,'2024-06-11',8,2,'Drukair Payment for May, 2024','<p>This is to submit to the Management that, FedEx Outbound Air Conveyance Freight charges amounting to<strong>&nbsp;</strong>Nu. 52,039.00 (thirty seven thousand four hundred sixty nine)<strong>&nbsp;</strong>only, payable to Ms. Druk Air Corporation Ltd. for the month of May, 2024. The budget for the same has been kept under Western Region (FedEx &amp; TNT unit) for the financial year 2024.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Therefore, the Division seeks the kind approval&nbsp;of the Management for release of payment as per the verified invoice (copy Attached).</p>',144,'2024-06-11 12:00:15','2024-06-11 14:50:33',8,76),
(9,'2024-06-12',9,2,'Air conveyance bill for May, 2024 Drukair','<p style=\"text-align: justify; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \'Trebuchet MS\',\'sans-serif\'; color: black;\">This is to submit to the management that the Air Conveyance Charges payable to M/s Drukair Corporation Ltd. on account of inbound and outbound mails carried for the month of May, 2024.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \'Trebuchet MS\',\'sans-serif\'; color: black;\">Total amounts to Nu. 1,190,158.69 (one thousand one hundred ninety thousand one hundred fifty eight &amp; Ch. Sixty nine) only, may be approved to release the payment to M/s Drukair&nbsp;Corporation Ltd. The budget for the same is kept provision under IMR unit for the financial year 2024.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \'Trebuchet MS\',\'sans-serif\'; color: black;\">Therefore, POD Division seeks the Management\'s kind approval. The verified invoice (scanned copy attached) for ready reference.</span></p>',144,'2024-06-12 09:19:05','2024-06-13 13:20:41',8,76),
(10,'2024-06-13',10,1,'Seeking kind approval for payment .','<p>This is to submit that after completion of re-roofing works of Thimphu GPO Building, we have requested laborers to carry out the following minor works which were not included with the re-roofing contract.</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Replacement of entrance celling glass with ply board</li>\r\n<li>Painting of PA&rsquo;s office</li>\r\n<li>Blocking of one window and painting of Head, FD office.</li>\r\n<li>Painting of small roof sheets</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>After careful negotiation, we mutually agreed at a lump sum rate of Nu. 17,000.00 (Nu. Seventeen Thousand) for these additional works.</p>\r\n<p>The cost incurred shall be booked from the budget head&nbsp;<strong>\" WIP- Roofing\"</strong>&nbsp;kept with AHRD.</p>\r\n<p>Therefore, we would like to seek kind approval for the payment, please.</p>',138,'2024-06-13 09:00:20','2024-06-13 13:20:04',8,36),
(11,'2024-06-13',11,1,'Trading and Depository Fee for May 2024','<p>This is to submit that the following Trading and Depository Fee were raised by RSEBL for the month of May 2024</p>\r\n<table width=\"637\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"7\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"556\">\r\n<p><strong>Trading &amp; Depository fee for the Month of May 2024</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"81\">\r\n<p><strong>Remarks</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"62\">\r\n<p><strong>SL.NO</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">\r\n<p><strong>Details</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"78\">\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;Buy </strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"78\">\r\n<p><strong>Sell</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"99\">\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;TOTAL VALUE </strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;Fees </strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">\r\n<p><strong>Total Trading &amp; Depository fee</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"5\" width=\"81\">\r\n<p><strong>Attached invoice</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"62\">\r\n<p>1</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">\r\n<p>Trading fee</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"78\">\r\n<p>&nbsp; 51,163.00</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"78\">\r\n<p>43,706.00</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"99\">\r\n<p>&nbsp; 5,605,030.87</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">\r\n<p>0.0015</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 8,407.55</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"62\">\r\n<p>2</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"85\">\r\n<p>Depository fee</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"78\">\r\n<p>&nbsp; 51,163.00</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"78\">\r\n<p>43,706.00</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"99\">\r\n<p>&nbsp; 5,605,030.87</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"66\">\r\n<p>0.00025</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"88\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1,401.26</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"6\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"467\">\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;TOTAL </strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"88\">\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 9,808.81 </strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"0\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Therefore, total of Nu. <strong>9,808.81 </strong><strong>/-(Nine Thousand Eight Hundred Eight and Chetrum Eight One)</strong> only may be approved to be released to RSEBL.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Submitted for kind approval please</p>',148,'2024-06-13 11:21:06','2024-06-14 16:21:47',8,108),
(12,'2024-06-13',12,1,'Refund of balance 50 % of retention money accumulated','<p>This is to appraise the management, that in line with GCC 48.2 and 48.3, the contractors have submitted the unconditional bank guarantee for the refund of 50 % of the retention money accumulated. We had made an initial refund of 50% of accumulated retention money up to 18th running accounts bills. The details are as follows:</p>\r\n<p>1. Unconditional bank guarantee amount: Nu.<strong> 7,980,000.00</strong> -----a</p>\r\n<p>2. Total retention money <span data-sheets-root=\"1\" data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:14389830.64}\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:30973,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;#,##0.00&quot;,&quot;3&quot;:1},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0}},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0}},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0}},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0}},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;9&quot;:1,&quot;10&quot;:1,&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:1},&quot;15&quot;:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;16&quot;:12,&quot;17&quot;:1}\" data-sheets-formula=\"=SUM(R[-30]C[0]:R[-1]C[0])\">accumulated</span> up to 26th RAB: Nu. <span data-sheets-root=\"1\" data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:14389830.64}\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quo