uot;:12,&quot;17&quot;:1}\" data-sheets-formula=\"=SUM(R[-30]C[0]:R[-1]C[0])\">The refund of Nu.<strong> 2,134,915.32 (</strong>Ngultrum Two million one hundred thirty-four thousand nine hundred and fifteen and chh. thirty-two only) shall be paid to the contractor&mdash;the difference amount of Nu. 785,084.68 shall be paid after the settlements of the final bills. The original bank guarantee has been submitted to the company secretary. The \"Letter of consent to extend charges/lien\" has been asked to be submitted for verification in original.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span data-sheets-root=\"1\" data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:14389830.64}\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:30973,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;#,##0.00&quot;,&quot;3&quot;:1},&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0}},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;6&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0}},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;7&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0}},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;8&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:[{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;5&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0}},{&quot;1&quot;:0,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;3&quot;:3},{&quot;1&quot;:1,&quot;2&quot;:0,&quot;4&quot;:1}]},&quot;9&quot;:1,&quot;10&quot;:1,&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:3,&quot;3&quot;:1},&quot;15&quot;:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;16&quot;:12,&quot;17&quot;:1}\" data-sheets-formula=\"=SUM(R[-30]C[0]:R[-1]C[0])\">It is submitted for review.&nbsp;</span></p>',135,'2024-06-13 14:29:05','2024-06-18 11:08:07',10,98),
(13,'2024-06-14',13,1,'Panel Members for Interview','<p>This is to apprise the Management that the recruitment for ICT, General Assistant Mnaagers and Postal Assistant (C&amp;F) Viva Interview is scheduled for 17 June 2024. The evaluation committe has screened out the top 10 candidates for General Assistant Manager, 2 candidates for ICT Assistant Manager and 1 Postal Assistant (C&amp;F).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>In this reagrd, the HR would like to propose and carry out the oral interview as scheduled for 17 June 2024 at 10:00 am sharp as per the details:</p>\r\n<p>1. <strong>Time: 10:00 am (Oral Interview)</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Pannel Members: (Assistant Manager)</strong></p>\r\n<p>1. Mr. Karma Nidup, CEO - Chairman</p>\r\n<p>2. Mr. Thinley Wangchuk, Head, Corporate - Member</p>\r\n<p>3. Ms. Rinchen Zangmo, Head, Finance - Member</p>\r\n<p>4. Ms. Sonam Peldon, Head, ICTD - Member</p>\r\n<p>5. Mr. Lham Wangchuk, RM, WR - Member</p>\r\n<p>This is being submitted for kind review and approval please.</p>\r\n<p>Submitted please</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',251,'2024-06-14 11:03:07','2024-06-18 14:26:41',21,892),
(14,'2024-06-17',14,1,'Payment approval for the sale of Revenue and Judicial stamps for the Month of May-2024','<p>This is to submit that, Bhutan Post has collected sale of Revenue and Judicial stamps for the Month of May-2024 vide RQ from four Regions.</p>\r\n<p>Kindly approve the paymeny of Nu.1,213,304/-(One Million Two Hundred Thirteen Thousand Three Hundred Four)only which is 80%of the sale to RRCO-MOF-Thimphu.</p>\r\n<p>Attached the details here with.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Submitted for approval please.</p>',157,'2024-06-17 10:01:31','2024-06-17 14:23:26',8,138),
(15,'2024-06-17',15,1,'Seeking kind  approval for auctioning of roofing materials. ','<p>This is to submit that we have roofing materials accumulated after carrying out of re-roofing project of Thimphu Building. After conducting a thorough review, it has become apparent that auctioning these materials is the most efficient and environmentally responsible method of disposal. This approach will not only help us manage waste effectively but also potentially generate additional revenue for the company.</p>\r\n<p>In order to ensure a transparent, I propose that we hold the auction following our Procurement Rules and Regulation 2022.</p>\r\n<p>Submitted for kind approval, please.</p>',138,'2024-06-17 12:31:44','2024-06-17 14:25:56',8,36),
(16,'2024-06-17',16,1,'Seeking payment approval Nu.59,907.70','<p>This to submit Management that, Philatelic Division has received a payment advice for Tax payment&nbsp; Nu.59,907.70to RRCO-MOF-Thimphu aganist the Printing stamps for UN joint issue. Submitted for approval plaese.</p>\r\n<p>Details attached herewith.</p>',157,'2024-06-17 16:04:57','2024-06-18 13:02:18',8,138),
