15&quot;:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;16&quot;:12,&quot;17&quot;:1}\" data-sheets-formula=\"=SUM(R[-30]C[0]:R[-1]C[0])\">The final bill is being verified, with the work value of Nu. 130 million. </span></p>\r\n<p>The calculated liquidated damages at 0.1% of the contract price of 134.44 million, for 53 days works out to Nu. 7.12 million. The amount for LD imposition shall be sufficient from the final bill settlements.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The remainder of the retention money shall be refunded/claimed as per the contract agreement, after the settlement of the final bills.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Submitted for kind review and approval, please.</p>',NULL,'2024-06-18 10:34:10','2024-06-18 10:34:10',2,98),
(18,'2024-06-18',18,1,'Rivision of House Rent ','<p>This is to bring to your kind attention that the lease agreement with Gedu College of Business Studies for the premises at Gedu PO is set to expire on 1st July 2024. The College Management has expressed interest in renewing the lease from 1st July 2024 onwards, with a proposed revision in accordance with the tenancy act, amounting to a 2% increase. This adjustment would bring the new rent payable to Nu 1434/- (1406 + 28) per the terms outlined.</p>\r\n<p>Therefore, we kindly request your approval for the enhancement of the rental payment to Gedu College of Business Studies, Gedu PO, effective from 1st July 2024 to 30th June 2026. We will promptly forward a copy of the Lease Agreement for your reference upon your approval Please.</p>\r\n<p>Thank you for considering this request. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Singye Rinzin</p>\r\n<p>Postmaster</p>\r\n<p>Gedu PO</p>',173,'2024-06-18 10:33:49','2024-06-20 15:22:14',10,177),
(19,'2024-06-18',19,1,'Submission for Approval of Maintenance of CCTV Cameras Bill','<p>This is to submit that the few CC cameras of Thimphu GPO Buiding has become unserviceable and needs immediate repair and maintenance. Upon our request to M/s. Vision Tech, Thimphu, the following works has been initiated and restored successfully. Therefore, we would like to seek your kind approval for payment of bill amounting to Nu. 20,700.00 (Ngultrum Twenty Thousand Seven Hundred only) as per Invoice No. VT/INV/0023 dated 11-June-2024.</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Power rectification of Cameras</li>\r\n<li>Reposition of Cameras</li>\r\n<li>Replacing one new camera</li>\r\n<li>New Display setup from NVR</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>The total cost incurred shall be booked from approved budget head \"CCTV\" allocated under the ICT Division for the current fiscal year 2024.</p>\r\n<p>Submitted for kind approval, Please.</p>',124,'2024-06-19 15:10:17','2024-06-19 15:14:28',8,133),
