p;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">9</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"4\">\r\n<p><strong>Incidental Expenses</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p><strong>500</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p><strong>42450</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">10</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"4\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Total DA entitlements</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p><strong>2,215</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p><strong>187832.00</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Exchange rate as on 24/06/2024- 1USD=Nu.84.8</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The air ticket round the trip as per the tender quotation called by MOIT is </span><strong>Nu.4,85,608.00</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">(Four Hundred Eighty Five Thousand Six hundred Eight) Only to Ms.Bhutan Bodhi Ticketing,Thimphu and all the expenses&nbsp; incurred shall be booked under EX-Country Training kept under Corporate Division for FY 2024.Sanction&nbsp; shall be accorded 90% DA to Dasho Phuntsho Tobgay sum of Nu.1,87,832.00 and Nu.4,85,608.00 to Ms.Bhutan Bodhi Ticketing ,Thimphu respectively.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The total expenditure incurred is </span><strong>Nu.673,440.00</strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Submitted based on the letter received from the Officiating Chief HR Officer vide letter number MoIT/HRD/20/2024/638 dated June 18,2024.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Submitted for kind approval please.</span></p>',131,'2024-06-25 12:30:35','2024-06-25 14:08:52',8,183),
(51,'2024-06-25',51,1,'Seeking kind approval for payment of building insurance premium','<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">This is to submit that the Bhutan Post buildings (Phuntsholing, Samtse, Sarpang, Tsirang, Zhemgang, Trongsa, Thimphu, Punakha, S/Jongkhar, Mongar and Trashigang) insurance with policy no.20000002111438624698 which is insured with Bhutan Insurance limited will expire on 01.07.2024.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Therefore, we would like to propose the reinsurance of buildings with the existing total sum insured of Nu. 79,611,891.00.00 which will cover fire, lightning, earthquake, Strom, Tempest and Cyclone.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bhutan Post has been paying an insurance premium of Nu. 137,548.00 for the policy period of 02.07.2023 to 01.07.2024. Upon my request for a discount, M/s. BIL agreed at a discounted premium of Nu. 134,797.00 for the policy period 02.07.2024 to 01.07.2025.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Therefore, AHRD would like to seek kind approval for reinsurance of Bhutan Post building with BIL at a total premium of Nu. 134,797.00 after discount.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The budget shall be utilized from the budget head&nbsp;<strong>\"</strong>&nbsp;<strong>EME Premises Cost - Insurance</strong><strong>\"&nbsp;</strong>kept under administration and HR Division for FY 2024.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;Submitted for kind approval, please</p>',138,'2024-06-25 15:00:47','2024-06-25 15:10:26',8,36),
(52,'2024-06-25',52,1,'Seeking kind approval for purchase of air ticket.','<p>This is to submit that as approved by the Chairman, the CEO will be attending the APPU Council Meeting from August 12 to August 17, 2024, in Cambodia. The round trip ticket from Paro- BKK has been booked directly from Drukair, as we are their corporate client. However, we could not book the round trip tickets from BKK to Cambodia through Drukair as they do not operate on that route.</p>\r\n<p>Therefore, we would like to seek kind approval for purchase of round trip tickets from BKK to Cambodia online. The estimate cost for these tickets will be approximately Nu. 68,772.00 or $ 811, including taxes at the exchange rate 1$ = 84.80 BTN as on today.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',138,'2024-06-25 15:14:10','2024-06-25 16:30:02',8,36),
(53,'2024-06-26',53,1,'Seeking approval to fill the stamps in the blank folder for corporate gifting purpose','<p>This is submitted for Management\'s kind approval to use the following stamps to fill the blank folder for the purpose of corporate gifting.</p>\r\n<p>Three varities of stamps are:</p>\r\n<p>1. Eight Auspecious Symbols, 100 nos * Nu. 60 per stamp</p>\r\n<p>2. Lunar Monkey year 2016 (Thuen Pa Puen Zhi), 100 nos * Nu.50</p>\r\n<p>3. Pilgrimage (Taktshang), 100 nos * Nu.100</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The 100 numbers of blank folder will be filled with above stamps and final Filled Folders will be handed over to Offie of CEO for gifting purpose.</p>\r\n<p>The budget head is under \"Marketing and Promotion Expenses\", Marketing unit, POD.</p>\r\n<p>Subimitted for Management\'s kind apprval, Please.</p>',158,'2024-06-26 12:04:31','2024-06-26 16:22:05',8,19),
(54,'2024-06-26',54,1,'Approval for Payment for Printing of Folders with Envelopes','<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Bhutan Post\'s service delivery across the country and marketing of its products and services are essential key features for our reach and awareness among the general public, as well as for souvenir purposes related to official matters.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">As part of our marketing initiatives for the promotion of Bhutan Post stamps, 100 folders with envelopes were printed by M/S Bhutan Printing Solutions, Thimphu. The rate per folder is Nu. 92, and the total cost for printing 100 folders amounts to </span><strong>Nu. 9,200.00 </strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">as attached to the invoice.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">It&rsquo;s requested&nbsp; the CEO to approve the payment of </span><strong>Nu. 9,200.00 </strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">to </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">M/S Bhutan Printing Solutions,</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Thimphu. The budget shall be utilized from the Budget </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Head &ldquo;Selling &amp; Distribution-Marketing&rdquo;</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> under the Business Planning Development and Marketing Unit for the year 2024.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Submitted for kind approval.</span></p>',131,'2024-06-26 13:43:12','2024-06-26 16:22:44',8,183),
(55,'2024-06-27',55,1,'PSWF','<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-grow flex-col max-w-full\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-[20px] text-message flex flex-col items-start whitespace-pre-wrap break-words [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5 juice:w-full juice:items-end overflow-x-auto gap-2\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"eaec51b4-1c62-4193-b34f-262a42c31c0c\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 juice:empty:hidden juice:first:pt-[3px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\">\r\n<p>I am writing to inform you that Mrs. Dechen Wangmo\'s mother passed away on June 26, 2024, at approximately 5 PM at home. In light of this emergency, we kindly request the release of a PSWF advance to assist her during this difficult time. The necessary documentation will be submitted upon the completion of the funeral arrangements.</p>\r\n<p>Your prompt approval of this request would be greatly appreciated.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-1 flex gap-3 empty:hidden juice:-ml-3\">\r\n<div class=\"items-center justify-start rounded-xl p-1 flex\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center\">\r\n<div class=\"flex\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center pb-0.5 juice:pb-0\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>',155,'2024-06-27 12:31:07','2024-06-27 12:31:07',2,24),
(56,'2024-06-27',56,1,'Seeking kind approval for carrying out disaster drill and serving tea and snacks during the drill session.','<p>This is to inform you that the annual disaster drill is scheduled to be held on July 1, 2024, at the Bhutan Post HQ Big Conference Hall. The session will be conducted by M/s. Bhutan Safety Traders at a negotiated price of Nu. 5,000.00 (Five Thousand). The drill session will last approximately one and a half hours.</p>\r\n<p>All staff from HQ and Thimphu GPO will participate, except for a few personnel who need to attend to customers.</p>\r\n<p>Additionally, we seek your kind approval for serving tea and water to the participants and resource personnel. The estimate cost will be around Nu. 3,000.00 (Three Thousand) only.</p>\r\n<p>The disaster drill fee will be paid from the budget head &ldquo;<strong>Repair &amp; Maintenance Costs - Office Equipment</strong>&rdquo; under ICTD for FY 2024.</p>\r\n<p>The expenses incurred for serving tea and snacks will be booked from the budget head &ldquo;<strong>Staff Welfare - Tea Expenses/Pantry&rdquo;</strong> under AHRD for FY 2024.</p>',138,'2024-06-27 13:14:13','2024-06-27 14:59:26',8,36),
(57,'2024-06-28',57,1,'Parking signage.','<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>I am writing to request approval for Thimphu GPO to purchase parking signage for visitors, tourists, and staff, as recommended by the APPU expert during the recent ORE review. The estimated cost for the signage is approximately Nu. 15000.00 (fifteen thousand)only, which will be covered by the repair and maintenance budget allocated to Thimphu GPO for 2024.</p>\r\n<p>submitted it for your kind approval, please.</p>',155,'2024-06-28 12:54:47','2024-07-01 16:46:27',8,24),
(58,'2024-07-01',58,1,'Seeking approval for mass printing of NCAH Joint Issue Stamp','<p>This is submitted for Management\'s kind approval to send the following stamps for printing to our Security Printer (<em>BrebnerPrint, New Zealand</em>) and FDCs to<em> Bhutan Printing Solution, Bhutan</em>.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Specification:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Souvenir Sheet: Sheet Size &ndash; 120 mm X 85 mm</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; Stamp Size &ndash; 45.6 mm X 35 mm</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; Colour &ndash; CMYK</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Paper &ndash; 102 GSM PVA Gummed</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Single sheet of 1 value stamp</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Denomination &ndash; Nu.45</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Qty: 5000 nos</p>\r\n<p>Serial numbers: 0015-5015</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sheet let:&nbsp; Sheet Size &ndash; 160 mm X 130 mm</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Stamp Size &ndash; 45.6 mm X 35 mm</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Colour &ndash; CMYK</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Paper &ndash; 102 GSM PVA Gummed</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Single sheet of 6 value stamps</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Denomination &ndash; Nu.30 each stamp</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Qty: 5000 nos</p>\r\n<p>Serial numbers: 0008-5008</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>FDcs: 230 mm * 110 mm</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;150 GSM Art Matte</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Color- CMYK</p>\r\n<p>Qty 2000 nos.</p>\r\n<p>The FDCs is proposed to 2000 nos since this FDC has Gyaltsuen and Gyalsem image which could help in selling more of our Souvenir sheets.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Submitted for kind approval please.</p>\r\n<p>Please find attached herewith the approved Digital Proof of stamps and FDC.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'2024-07-01 12:26:07','2024-07-01 12:26:07',2,NULL),
(59,'2024-07-01',59,1,'Seeking approval for printing of NCAH Joint Issue Stamp','<p>This is submitted for Management\'s kind approval to send the following stamps for printing to our Security Printer ( <em>Brebnerprint, New Zealand</em>) and FDCs to <em>Bhutan Priting Solution, Bhutan</em>.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Specification:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Souvenir Sheet: Sheet Size &ndash; 120 mm X 85 mm</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; Stamp Size &ndash; 45.6 mm X 35 mm</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; Colour &ndash; CMYK</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Paper &ndash; 102 GSM PVA Gummed</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Single sheet of 1 value stamp</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Denomination &ndash; Nu.45</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Qty: 5000 nos</p>\r\n<p>Serial numbers: 0015-5015</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Sheet let: Sheet Size &ndash; 160 mm X 130 mm</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Stamp Size &ndash; 45.6 mm X 35 mm</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Colour &ndash; CMYK</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Paper &ndash; 102 GSM PVA Gummed</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Single sheet of 6 value stamps</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Denomination &ndash; Nu.30 each stamp</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Qty: 5000 nos</p>\r\n<p>Serial numbers: 0008-5008</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>FDCs: 230mm X 110 mm</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;150 GSM Art Matte</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Color- CMYK</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Qty - 2000 nos</p>\r\n<p>The FDC quantity is proposed to 2000 nos since this FDc has the image of Gyaltsuen and Gyalsem which could help in selling more of Souvenir Sheet stamps.</p>\r\n<p>Submitted for kind approval please.</p>\r\n<p>Please find attached herewith the approved Digital proof for Stamps and soft copy of FDC.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',158,'2024-07-01 12:34:20','2024-07-01 16:45:08',8,19),
(60,'2024-07-02',60,1,'Approval to purchase heavy duty printer','<p>This is to submit that the printer we purchased in 2018 is having a problem with the daily heavy printing required for WUMT. The Finance Division has kept the budget to purchase 1 heavy-duty printer with the implementation of ERP. Now, with the decision to replace MIS with the ERP system and from 2025, we will be fully using the ERP system.</p>\r\n<p>Therefore, I would like to request Dasho CEO to kindly approve to purchase of 1 heavy-duty printer. The capital budget is kept with ICT Division.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',128,'2024-07-16 11:14:49','2024-07-16 12:48:19',8,62),
(61,'2024-07-02',61,1,'Approval for Printing 18 Copies of the Board of Directors Report 2023','<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Corporate Division seeks approval to print 18 copies of the Board of Directors Report 2023 for annual filing returns and other official related matters.T</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">he cost of printing one booklet of 26 pages costs Nu.215/-,for 18 copies it comes to Nu.3,870/-</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;The budget will be utilized from the \"Printing of Stationery\" allocation under procurement in AHRD for FY 2024.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Submitted for your kind approval, please.</span></p>',131,'2024-07-02 12:16:03','2024-07-02 14:08:54',8,183),
(62,'2024-07-02',62,1,'Purchase of Stationery and cartridge based pn annual quotation rate ','<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This is to submit that the Procurement Unit, AHRD would like to purchase the following Stationery, cartridges and printing items of total amounting to Nu. 48,140</span><strong>.00</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> (Ngultrum Forty Eight Thousand One Hundred Forty) only, for further supply to Divisions/Regions/POs based on annual quoted rate 2024.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">1)</span> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Photocopy Paper (A4) = 100 reams @ Nu. 220 =&nbsp; Nu.22,900.00</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2) Stapler Machine 24/6 = 20 boxes @ Nu. 127 = Nu. 2,540.00</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">3) Cartridge 26A = 5 nos. @ Nu. 1,400 = Nu. 7,000.00</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">4) Register Book no. 30 = 30 booklets @ Nu.240 = Nu. 7,200.00</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">5) Arch File = 100 nos. @ Nu. 85 = Nu. 8,500.00</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The cost shall be booked from approved budget head </span><strong>&ldquo;purchase of Stationery and purchase of cartridges\' </strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;kept under AHRD for the FY 2024.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Therefore, we would like to seek kind approval for purchase of </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">aforementioned items to replenish the stock to operate the day to day work smoothly</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Please</span></p>',139,'2024-07-02 14:58:18','2024-07-02 16:09:19',8,20),
(63,'2024-07-03',63,1,'Final Bill for site development works','<p>This is to seek the kind approval of the management for payment of final bills for site development works, amounting to <strong>Nu. 414,825.04</strong> (four hundred fourteen thousand eight hundred twenty five and ch. four only) in favor of M/s Shekhar Construction. The final bill submission was raised for <strong>Nu. 564,497.86</strong>. The documents are attached for your kind reference. The summary of the final bill are as follows:</p>\r\n<p>Total work value= Nu. 414,825.04</p>\r\n<p>Retention money @ 10%= Nu. 41,482.50</p>\r\n<p>TDS @ 2 %= Nu. 8,296.50</p>\r\n<p>The net amount payable = Nu. 365,046.04</p>\r\n<p>Submitted for kind approval, please.&nbsp;</p>',135,'2024-07-03 13:01:33','2024-07-04 16:43:24',8,98),
(64,'2024-07-04',64,1,'Seeking approval for payment of cancellation seal for UN Peacekeeping and NCAH Joint Issue stamps','<p>This is to submitted for Management\'s kind approval to make payment for two cancellation seals, one for UN Peacekeeping and other, for National Centre for Animal Health (NCAH) Joint Issue stamps.</p>\r\n<p>The cost for two cancellation seal is approximately Nu.1200 each amounting Nu. 2400.00 (Ngultrum Two Thousand Four Hundred) only for two numbers of seal from Quality Arts and Prints, Thimphu.</p>\r\n<p>Submitted for your kind approval please.</p>',NULL,'2024-07-04 10:36:38','2024-07-04 10:36:38',2,NULL),
(65,'2024-07-04',65,1,'Seeking approval for payment of cancellation seal for UN Peacekeeping and NCAH Joint Issue stamps','<p><span data-sheets-root=\"1\" data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;This is to submitted for CEO\'s kind approval to make payment for two cancellation seals, one for UN Peacekeeping and other, for National Centre for Animal Health (NCAH) Joint Issue stamps.&quot;}\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:513,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;12&quot;:0}\">This is to submitted for Management\'s kind approval to make payment for two cancellation seals, one for UN Peacekeeping and other, for National Centre for Animal Health (NCAH) Joint Issue stamps.</span></p>\r\n<p><span data-sheets-root=\"1\" data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;This is to submitted for CEO\'s kind approval to make payment for two cancellation seals, one for UN Peacekeeping and other, for National Centre for Animal Health (NCAH) Joint Issue stamps.&quot;}\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:513,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;12&quot;:0}\">The cost for two cancellation seal is approximately Nu.1200 each amounting Nu. 2400.00 (Ngultrum Two Thousand Four Hundred) only for two numbers of seal from Quality Arts and Prints, Thimphu.</span></p>\r\n<p><span data-sheets-root=\"1\" data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;This is to submitted for CEO\'s kind approval to make payment for two cancellation seals, one for UN Peacekeeping and other, for National Centre for Animal Health (NCAH) Joint Issue stamps.&quot;}\" data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:513,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;12&quot;:0}\">Submitted for your kind approval please.</span></p>',158,'2024-07-04 10:39:31','2024-07-04 11:34:39',8,19),
(66,'2024-07-04',66,1,'Final Bill for Construction of B+G+4+Jamthok regional office and commecial building in Gelephu','<p>The field team would like to seek the approval of the management for the payment of the final bills. The total value of work before application of rebate is&nbsp;</p>',135,'2024-07-04 10:41:26','2024-07-04 10:41:26',2,98),
(67,'2024-07-04',67,1,'Final Bill payable for Elevator installed in B+G+4+jamthok in Gelephu','<p>The field team would like to seek the approval of the management for the final bill payment in favor of M/s S.L lubricants. The bid amount was Nu. 29,000,000.00 (Twenty nine million only). Due to some of the installations finishes being under specifications, mainly instead of a stainless mirror finish, it was a stainless hairline finish. The calculated amount for deductions shall be Nu. 125,146.43 (One hundred twenty-five thousand one hundred and forty six and chh. forty-three only). The summary of the bills is as follows:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>1. Bid price=Nu. 2,900,000.00</p>\r\n<p>2. First 70% payment = Nu. 2,030,000.00</p>\r\n<p>3. Balance = Nu. 870,000.00</p>\r\n<p>4. Deductions for under specifications of material = Nu. 125,146.43</p>\r\n<p>5. Net payable after adjustment and deductions = Nu. <strong>655,471.14.</strong></p>\r\n<p>The details of the bills and rates are attached for reference.</p>',135,'2024-07-11 12:24:55','2024-07-12 14:03:39',8,98),
(68,'2024-07-04',68,1,'Air conveyance payment to Japan Airlines for M/O. June 2024','<p>This is to submit to the management that the EMS bags sent to various destinations from Bhutan beyond Bangkok has been carried by the following airlines with the following claims:</p>\r\n<p>Airline: Japan Airlines Company Ltd.</p>\r\n<p>Month: June 2024</p>\r\n<p>Amount(SDR): 12,651.00 equivalent to USD 16,655.93 (Exchange @ 1.316570 as of 03/07/2024)</p>\r\n<p>Therefore, a total USD 16,655.93 (One Thousand Six Hundred Fifty-Five and Cents Ninety Three) may only be approved for the payment to M/s Japan Airlines Company Ltd. The budget for the same is kept provision under four regions (IMR unit) for the financial year 2024.</p>\r\n<p>The sanctioned net amount in USD may be paid to the above carriers after deducting the bank charges. Therefore, the same has been submitted for management\'s approval to release the payment. The verified invoice is attached for your kind reference.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',156,'2024-07-04 11:30:28','2024-07-04 16:41:07',8,96),
(69,'2024-07-04',69,1,'Payment to UPU*Clearing House for the month of June-2024','<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The sum of $ 10,368.40 is payable to UPU*Clearing House as per the netting statement of June 2024 which shows Bhutan Post is on the liability side. The budget for the same is kept under the IMR unit in the financial year 2024</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Therefore, USD 10,368.40 (USD Ten Thousand Three Hundred Sixty-Eight and Cents Forty) Only may be approved for the payment to UPU*CLearing House.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The total USD 10,368.40 has to be paid to the above-mentioned party without deducting any charges. All charges related are borne by us. The verified UPU Netting statement is attached for your kind reference.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',156,'2024-07-04 11:47:49','2024-07-04 16:42:32',8,96),
(70,'2024-07-04',70,1,'Refund for damaged FedEx shipment','<p>This is to submit to the management that we have received an FedEx package with Airway Bill (AWB) number 275570763122 from USA on 27th June 2024. The package was booked and dispatched on 6th June 2024 from USA and took more than 20 days in transit. On 27th June when we received a package it was completely damaged by rain.The consignee was lodged a complaint with refund of USD 105.86 which he paid for service to ship the documents from USA to Bhutan.</p>\r\n<p>The same has been informed and claimed to FedEx, Delhi on 27 June 2024 at 6:30pm.As requested, Delhi FedEx has approved the claime of USD 105.86 which is Nu.8982.22.Hence, POD would like to request management to kindly approved to pay Nu.8,982.22 (FOREX rate 84.85 as 04.07.2024) to Mr. Sonam Gyeltshen(customer).&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The budget can be met from Budget Head\" FedEx expenses\"ketp with Postal Operation Division with 0.122 million. The same amount can be replace back after claiming from FedEx Delhi.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'2024-07-04 16:50:02','2024-07-04 16:50:02',2,NULL),
(71,'2024-07-05',71,1,'Refund for damaged FedEx shipment','<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This is to submit to the management that we have received a FedEx package with Airway Bill number 275570763122 from the USA on 27th June 2024. The package was booked on 6th June 2024 from the USA and it took 20 days to reach Bhutan.When we received the package on 27th June 2024, the package was damaged by the rain and&nbsp; the same was informed to FedEx, Delhi.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">While attempting delivery, we have received a complaint from a customer stating that it is an important document but it is all damaged and he needs a refund of USD 105.86 which he has paid for service charges to&nbsp; send the document from the USA to Bhutan.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">FedEx Unit has made a claim to Delhi FedEx and the same amount USD 105.86 has been approved by FedEx, Delhi. Thus, we would like to seek kind approval from Management to pay USD 105.86 which is Nu. 8,976.92 (forex rate 84.8) to the customer. The same amount shall be reimbursed from FedEx Delhi.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The payment shall be made from Budget head &ldquo;FedEx expenses&rdquo; kept with POD&nbsp; for the financial year 2024.</span></p>',140,'2024-07-05 10:04:12','2024-07-08 14:38:59',8,18),
(72,'2024-07-06',72,1,'Advance salary for july and august month ','<p>due to my domestic problem i would like to ask advance salary for the month of july and august month amount of 15000/- ( fifteen thousand) only.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',269,'2024-07-06 09:29:17','2024-07-08 16:41:48',8,5),
(73,'2024-07-08',73,1,'Approval to Payout Interpretation Costs of POC','<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The UPU, Berne has invoiced Bhutan Post for the interpretation costs of the POC, dated 21 May 2024. The costs cover simultaneous interpretation into Arabic, French, Russian, and Spanish during the session of the POC and its bodies\' meetings in October/November 2023.The said virtual meeting was attended by Former General Manager Mr.Jigme Tenzin from 26 October 2023 to 27 October 2023.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The interpretation cost is </span><strong>CHF 42.27,</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> invoiced to Bhutan Post with reference to Article 22 of the Rules of Procedure of the POC. The CHF 42.27, equivalent to</span><strong> Nu. 3,976.00</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> (1 CHF is Nu. 94.05 as of 8/7/2024), should be booked under &ldquo;PE-Statutory Fee-APP/UPU-2024&rdquo; for the Corporate Division.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The documents and invoice are attached for your reference.</span></p>',131,'2024-07-08 14:49:34','2024-07-09 12:50:06',8,183),
(74,'2024-07-09',74,1,'Mail carriage charges for LEO global Logistics','<p style=\"text-align: justify; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: \'Trebuchet MS\',\'sans-serif\'; color: black;\">Submitted that the EMS bags sent to various destinations from Bhutan beyond Bangkok has been carried by the following cargo company with the following claims:</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: \'Trebuchet MS\',\'sans-serif\'; color: black;\">Airline: LEO GOBAL LOGISTICS PUBLIC COMPANY LIMITED</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: \'Trebuchet MS\',\'sans-serif\'; color: black;\">Month : April, May and June, 2024 = $ 9,498.62</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: \'Trebuchet MS\',\'sans-serif\'; color: black;\">Month : May 2024 additional Invoices = $ 311.20</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: \'Trebuchet MS\',\'sans-serif\'; color: black;\">Total Amount (USD): (9,498.62 + 311.20) = $ 9,809.82</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: \'Trebuchet MS\',\'sans-serif\'; color: black;\">Therefore, total USD. 9,809.82 (nine thousand eight hundred nine &amp; eighty two) only may be approved for payment to M/s LEO GLOBAL LOGISTICS PUBLIC COMPANY LINITED. The budget for the same is kept provision under four regions (IMR unit) for the financial year and 2024.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: \'Trebuchet MS\',\'sans-serif\'; color: black;\">The sanctioned net amount in USD may be paid to the above carriers after deducting the bank charges. Therefore, the same has been submitted for Managements kind approval to release the payment. The verified invoice is attached for your kind references.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: \'Trebuchet MS\',\'sans-serif\'; color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.5pt; font-family: \'Trebuchet MS\',\'sans-serif\'; color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></p>',144,'2024-07-09 10:13:22','2024-07-11 15:52:09',8,76),
(75,'2024-07-09',75,2,'Air conveyance bill for June, 2024 Drukair','<p>This is to submit that to the Management that FedEx Outbound Air conveyance Freight charges amounting to<strong>&nbsp;</strong>Nu.38,258.00 (thirty eight thousand two hundred fifty eight)<strong>&nbsp;</strong>only, payable to Ms. Drukair Corporation Ltd. for the month of June, 2024. The budget for the same has been kept under Western Region (FedEx &amp; TNT unit) for&nbsp;the financial year 2024.</p>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>Therefore, the Division seeks the kind approval&nbsp;of the Management for release of payment as per the verified invoice (copy Attached).</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',144,'2024-07-09 10:48:53','2024-07-11 15:53:06',8,76),
(76,'2024-07-09',76,1,'FedEx and TNT payment till March, 2024','<p>This is to submit to the management that the FedEx and TNT account for the year 2022 has been settled on 9<sup>th</sup> May 2023. Due to frequent transition of staff under the FedEx unit, the FedEx account for the year 2023 has not been settled to date.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Recently, we have received a bill amounting to USD 39,094.29 being the FedEx &amp; TNT raw rate payment to be settled immediately till March 2024 with the FedEx USD bank account.&nbsp; The bills have been verified and found weight discrepancy in Freight invoice amounting to USD 8,074.71 against the Import Freight Invoice and another UDS. 3,474.82 against the Export Freight Invoice which amounts to a total of USD 11,549.53. POD is following-up with the FedEx &amp; TNT for actual weight claims and requesting to re-submit the invoice. However, after putting on hold for USD. 11,549.53, the payable amounts totals to USD. 27,544.76 which is equivalent to Nu. 2,335,795.64 (two thousand three hundred thirty-five thousand seven hundred ninety-five &amp; Ch. sixty-four) only.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;In this regard, the Postal Operation Division would like to seek kind approval from the Management for release of the above mentioned USD (27,544.76) to FedEx &amp; TNT. The verified invoice of the claim has been attached for ready reference.&nbsp;</p>',144,'2024-07-09 15:02:43','2024-07-15 11:24:42',8,76),
(77,'2024-07-11',77,2,'Payment for prime fee 2024','<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This is to submit to the management that we have received a bill amounting to EUR 575.00 only against the prime fee for the year 2024.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The payment in ngultrum is 52,555.00 (fifty two thousand five hundred and fifty five) only as on 11.07.2024 (Forex) of BOB.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The budget shall be made from the budget head &ldquo;PE statutory fee- </span><a href=\"http://ips.post/CDS.Post/Post.net\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">IPS.post/CDS.Post/Post.net</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> mail/prime&rdquo; kept with POD with approved budget of Nu. 1.450 million.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">submitted for kind approval by the management.</span></p>',140,'2024-07-11 11:47:00','2024-07-11 15:50:21',8,18),
(78,'2024-07-11',78,2,'Drukair Payment for June, 2024 against inbound & outbound mail carriage charges.','<p style=\"text-align: justify; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \'Trebuchet MS\',sans-serif; color: black;\">This is to submit to the management that Air Conveyance charges payable to M/s Drukair Corporation Ltd. on account of inbound and outbound mails carried for the month of&nbsp;June, 2024.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \'Trebuchet MS\',sans-serif; color: black;\">Total Amount of Nu. 1,192,234.17 (one thousand one hundred ninety-two thousand two hundred thirty-four &amp; Ch. seventeen) only, may be approved for release of payment to M/s Drukair&nbsp;Corporation Ltd. The budget for the same is kept provision under IMR unit for the financial year 2024.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \'Trebuchet MS\',sans-serif; color: black;\">Therefore, the Management is requested to accord kind approval to release the payment. The scanned copy of the verified invoice is attached for ready reference.</span></p>',144,'2024-07-11 11:51:32','2024-07-11 15:51:11',8,76),
(79,'2024-07-11',79,1,'Advance salary','<p>Due to domestic problem i would like to ask adance salary for the month of&nbsp; july and august 2024 amount of Nu.20000.00(Twenty Thousand) only</p>',197,'2024-07-11 11:51:46','2024-07-12 14:01:31',8,17),
(80,'2024-07-11',80,1,'Smart lock system rate analysis','<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The field team would like to appraise the management for the accord of sanction of the following work for implementation for &ldquo;Construction of B+G+4+jamthok&rdquo;.</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Smart Lock systems for the hotel rooms:</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table style=\"font-weight: 400;\" width=\"635\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"47\">\r\n<p>Sl. No</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">\r\n<p>Description</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"57\">\r\n<p>Unit</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">\r\n<p>Rate</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"64\">\r\n<p>Quantity</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"109\">\r\n<p>Amount</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"47\">\r\n<p>1</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">\r\n<p>Providing and fixing smart lock digital for guest room doors (Dolphy make)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"57\">\r\n<p>each</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">\r\n<p>17856.85</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"64\">\r\n<p>45</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"109\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;803,558.25</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"47\">\r\n<p>2</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">\r\n<p>Providing of mifare card for digital lock model no. DHDL0003-S (Dolphy make)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"57\">\r\n<p>each</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 243.80</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"64\">\r\n<p>50</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"109\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 12,190.00</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"47\">\r\n<p>3</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">\r\n<p>Providing and fixing key FOB switch or energy saving switch for hotel guest rooms</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"57\">\r\n<p>each</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">\r\n<p>836.78</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"64\">\r\n<p>45</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"109\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 37,655.10</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"47\">\r\n<p>4</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">\r\n<p>Providing of USB room card encoder (DHDL0007)-Dolphy make</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"57\">\r\n<p>each</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">\r\n<p>76979.46</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"64\">\r\n<p>1</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"109\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 76,979.46</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"47\">\r\n<p>5</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;Providing of&nbsp; handset (wireless portable programmer) for digital smart lock systems</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"57\">\r\n<p>each</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">\r\n<p>115360.1</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"64\">\r\n<p>1</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"109\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 115,360.14</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"47\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"284\">\r\n<p>Total Amount</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"57\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"75\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"64\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"109\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1,045,742.95</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Submitted for approval please.&nbsp;</p>',135,'2024-07-11 17:50:32','2024-07-11 17:50:32',2,98),
(81,'2024-07-12',81,1,'Request for  Approval of Payment for  New CCTV Cameras Installation','<p>This is to submit that, in order to enhance the security surveillance of the Thimphu GPO building, we have initiated the installation of additional CCTV cameras. Following our request to M/s Vision Tech, Thimphu, they have installed six additional CCTV cameras.</p>\r\n<p>Therefore, we kindly seek your approval for the payment of Nu. 33,740.00 (Thirty-Three Thousand Seven Hundred Forty) only, as per Invoice No. VT/INV/0027 dated 05-July-2024. A copy of the invoice is attached for your kind reference.</p>\r\n<p>The total cost incurred shall be booked from approved budget head &ldquo;CCTV&rdquo; allocated under the ICT Division for the current fiscal year 2024.</p>\r\n<p>Submitted for Kind approval, Please.</p>',124,'2024-07-12 09:43:15','2024-07-15 11:23:04',8,133),
(82,'2024-07-12',82,1,'Final Bill payable for Elevator installed in B+G+4+jamthok in Gelephu','<p>The field team would like to seek the kind approval of the management for the final bill payment in favor of M/s S.L lubricants. The bid amount was Nu. 2,900,000.00 (Two million Nine hundred only). Due to some of the installations finishes being under specifications, mainly instead of a stainless mirror finish, it was a stainless hairline finish. The calculated amount for deductions shall be Nu. 125,146.43 (One hundred twenty-five thousand one hundred and forty six and chh. forty-three only). The summary of the bills is as follows:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>1. Bid price=Nu. 2,900,000.00</p>\r\n<p>2. First 70% payment = Nu. 2,030,000.00</p>\r\n<p>3. Balance = Nu. 870,000.00</p>\r\n<p>4. Deductions for under specifications of material = Nu. 125,146.43</p>\r\n<p>5. Net payable after adjustment and deductions = Nu.&nbsp;<strong>655,471.14.</strong></p>\r\n<p>The details of the bills and rates are attached for reference.</p>',135,'2024-07-12 10:14:23','2024-07-15 15:07:49',8,98),
(83,'2024-07-12',83,1,'Advance of one month basic pay','<p>Sir/Madam</p>\r\n<p>I want to lay a few words for your kind consideration.</p>\r\n<p>Since my transfer has been approved, I would like to request an advance of one month of basic pay. It will greatly help in meeting the expenses of resetting up base in Thimphu from Gelephu.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>It is submitted for kind approval, please.&nbsp;</p>',135,'2024-07-12 10:50:24','2024-07-12 14:00:25',8,98),
(84,'2024-07-15',84,1,'Test','<p>sgdhkflb&nbsp; &nbsp;xc vg</p>',128,'2024-07-15 10:14:34','2024-07-15 10:16:11',8,62),
(85,'2024-07-15',85,1,'ssnn','<p>bjbfhife</p>',318,'2024-07-15 10:16:29','2024-07-15 10:16:29',2,906),
(86,'2024-07-15',86,1,'Payment approval for the sale of Revenue and Judicial stamps for the Month of June-2024.','<p>This is to submit that,Bhutan Post has collected sale of Revenue and Judicail stamps for the month of June-2024 vide RQ from four Regions.</p>\r\n<p>Kindly approve the payment of Nu.1,240,012/-(One Million Two Hundred Fourty Thousand Twelve ) only which is 80% of the sale to RRCO-MOF-Thimphu.</p>',157,'2024-07-15 16:02:20','2024-07-16 09:41:11',10,138),
(87,'2024-07-15',87,1,'Requirement of Laptop to Mr.Ugyen Wangchuk, Assistant Manager (HR)','<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This is to apprise Mr.Ugyen Wangchuk, Assistant Manager who was transferred from S/Jongkhar GPO to AHRD vide order No. BP/AHR/PER-03/2024/581 dated 31.05.2024 and has joined his duty w.e.f. 15th July 2024.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Upon his joining, he is left without the laptop which is essential for smooth functioning of day to day activities. We made every attempt to make arrangements after consulting with ICT, but we were unable to.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In this regard, we kindly propose the purchase of a laptop within the budget provision allocated under AHRD for the financial year 2024.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Submitted for your kind approval, please.</span></p>',141,'2024-07-15 17:04:00','2024-07-15 17:12:17',6,10),
(88,'2024-07-16',88,1,'Payment approval for the sale of Revenue and Judicial stamps for the Month of June-2024','<p>This is to submit that,Bhutan Post has collected sale of Revenue and Judicail stamps for the month of June-2024 vide RQ from four Regions.</p>\r\n<p>Kindly approve the payment of Nu.1,240,012/-(Ngultrum One Million Two Hundred Fourty Thousand Twelve ) only which is 80% of the sales to RRCO-MOF-Thimphu.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Submitted for kind approval, please.</p>\r\n<p>The deatils of the sales are attached for your kind reference.</p>',158,'2024-07-16 09:45:28','2024-07-16 09:45:28',2,19),
(89,'2024-07-16',89,1,'Payment approval for the sale of Revenue and Judicial stamps for the Month of June-2024.','<p>This is to submit that,Bhutan Post has collected sale of Revenue and Judicail stamps for the month of June-2024 vide RQ from four Regions.</p>\r\n<p>Kindly approve the payment of Nu.1,240,012/-(Ngultrum One Million Two Hundred Fourty Thousand and Twelve ) only which is 80% of the sale to RRCO-MOF-Thimphu.</p>\r\n<p>Submitted for kind approval please.</p>\r\n<p>Tha details of the sales are attached for your reference la.</p>',158,'2024-07-16 10:00:05','2024-07-16 12:50:20',8,19),
(90,'2024-07-16',90,1,'seeking kind approval for purchase of refill water from Bhutan Agro','<p>This is to submit that the contract agreement with our previous supplier of refill water has expired. Upon requesting the continuation of supply, the supplier informed us that they have discontinued their refill water business.</p>\r\n<p>In response, the AHRD conducted a market exploration and identified Bhutan Agro as a genuine supplier, given their status as a government agency. After consulting with Mr. Prakesh Pradhan, Manager of the Marketing Department at Bhutan Agro, we have been offered the following rates:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Initial rate per jar: Nu. 250</li>\r\n<li>Total initial amount for 30 jars: Nu. 7,500</li>\r\n<li>Subsequent refill cost per jar: Nu. 100</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>We believe Bhutan Agro\'s offer is reasonable and reliable.</p>\r\n<p>The budget balance for refill water is Nu. 84,400.00 for kind information</p>\r\n<p>Therefore, we kindly seek your approval to proceed with the proposal to engage Bhutan Agro as our new supplier for refill water.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',139,'2024-07-16 12:59:52','2024-07-16 15:34:19',8,20),
(91,'2024-07-16',91,1,'Seeking approval for Audit & Inspection of Thimphu GPO.','<p>This is to submit that as per the annual work plan 2024 thus approved by the Board of Audit Committee, the audit and inspection of the Post Offices under the Eastern Regions were proposed during the month of July 2024, which could not be conducted as scheduled due to onset of the monsoon season which poses high risk while traveling.</p>\r\n<p>Additionally, a team from the Customs Office (Post-Clearance Audit) initiated their audit and inspection of International and domestic mail services and their system operations effective from 8<sup>th</sup> July 2024 for one week, accordingly the CEO instructed IAU to postpone the field visit until completion of Post Clearance Audit.</p>\r\n<p>However, due to the nature of the workload, their activities are ongoing after which they will inform this office for further action.&nbsp;Given these circumstances, the internal audit team was unable to carry out the scheduled work plan. However, we would like to inform the Management that this office will commence the audit and inspection of Thimphu GPO starting on 22<sup>nd</sup> July 2024 which was focused on August September 2024. The field audit of PO&rsquo;s under the eastern region needs to be rescheduled in August /September 2024.</p>\r\n<p>Therefore, Management is requested to consider our request as proposed and IAU shall submit the approved note to the BAC Chairman for kind endorsement please.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Submitted please.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',147,'2024-07-16 13:13:08','2024-07-17 11:05:01',8,154),
(92,'2024-07-16',92,1,'Approval for the Renewal of Checkpoint License','<p>This is to apprise the management that the ICT Division seeks approval for the renewal of the Checkpoint 3100 NGTX license for an additional period of one year, from 31/07/24 to 31/07/25, as the license has reached its expiry date.</p>\r\n<p>The Checkpoint 3100 NGTX is currently used for network security and threat prevention for our organization. M/s Zealous Systems Pvt. Limited has been providing the Checkpoint 3100 NGTX license to date with prompt and dedicated sales service support.</p>\r\n<p>The cost of the license renewal for one year is Nu. 215,289.00 The cost incurred will be adjusted from the approved License Renewal budget under the ICT Division for the Financial Year 2024.</p>\r\n<p>Submitted for your kind approval.</p>',249,'2024-07-16 16:03:55','2024-07-17 11:06:03',8,908),
(93,'2024-07-16',93,1,'seeking kind approval for purchase of 15 chairs ','<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This is to seek approval for the purchase of 15 full revolving chairs, each priced at Nu. 5,648, amounting to a total of Nu. 84,720.00 (Ngultrum Eighty Four Thousand Seven Hundred Twenty) only.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The allocation of the chairs is as follows:</span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">AFD: 4 nos.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">OD: 2 nos.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">CR: 3 nos.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">WR: 3 nos.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Phy: 3 nos.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The budget provision for this purchase is kept under the capital budget head \"Furniture and Fixture\" for the fiscal year 2024.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Therefore, seeking kind approval to proceed with this purchase.</span></p>',139,'2024-07-16 16:51:07','2024-07-17 11:07:35',8,20),
(94,'2024-07-16',94,1,'Approval for purchase of laptop equipment.','<p>This is to apprise management that the ICT Division has received requisitions for the purchase of laptops. Currently, the ICT Division lacks a sufficient number of functional laptops, and the existing ones are either outdated or experiencing significant issues that hamper productivity.</p>\r\n<p>To address the workload and ensure smooth operations, there is an urgent need for new laptops to ensure the continuous and reliable operation of services. The ICT Division would like to propose and submit for management approval the procurement of five laptops.</p>\r\n<p>The procurement of the laptops will be based on Bhutan Post\'s annual quotation rates and specifications, which are Nu. 84,440 per Dell laptop. The budget will be met from the approved capital budget allocated for laptop equipment under the ICT Division for the Financial Year 2024.</p>\r\n<p>Submitted for your kind approval.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',249,'2024-07-16 17:00:39','2024-07-17 10:30:15',10,908),
(95,'2024-07-17',95,1,'Approval of rates for additional work for M/s Shekhar Construction','<p>The field team would like to seek the management\'s approval for the rates for the following works. The site development works were awarded to M/s Shekhar Construction.</p>\r\n<table width=\"839\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"46\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td width=\"381\">Site development works for B+G+4+jamthok in Gelephu</td>\r\n<td width=\"69\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td width=\"47\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td width=\"84\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td width=\"87\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td width=\"125\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"46\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>Contractor: M/s Shekhar Construction</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td width=\"125\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"46\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>Rates for additional works</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td width=\"125\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"46\">Sl. No.</td>\r\n<td width=\"381\">Additional Works</td>\r\n<td width=\"69\">Qty</td>\r\n<td>Unit</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;Rate&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;Amount&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td width=\"125\">Remarks</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"46\">D.1</td>\r\n<td width=\"381\">Excavation in foundation trenches or drains not exceeding 1.5m in width or area 10 sq.m on plan, including dressing &amp; ramming, disposal of surplus soil within 50m lead &amp; 1.5m lift-All soil types</td>\r\n<td width=\"69\">15.766</td>\r\n<td>cu.m</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 221.50</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3,492.17</td>\r\n<td width=\"125\">BSR 2023 rates, EW0106</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"46\">D.1.2</td>\r\n<td width=\"381\">Providing &amp; laying with hard stone (average volume 0.008 Cu.m) hand packed stone masonry in cement concrete mortar 1:3:6, 20mm aggregates</td>\r\n<td width=\"69\">5.344</td>\r\n<td>cu.m</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 4,313.37</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp; 23,050.65</td>\r\n<td width=\"125\">BSR 2023 rates, SM0061</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"46\">D.1.3</td>\r\n<td width=\"381\">Providing &amp; fixing centering and shuttering (formwork), including strutting, propping etc. and removal of formwork</td>\r\n<td width=\"69\">28.059</td>\r\n<td>sq.m</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 392.21</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp; 11,005.02</td>\r\n<td width=\"125\">BSR 2023 rates, RC0090</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"46\">D.1.4</td>\r\n<td width=\"381\">&nbsp;Demolishing cement concrete 1:4:8 &amp; leaner, including disposal of materials within 50m lead</td>\r\n<td width=\"69\">0.053</td>\r\n<td>cu.m</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 674.30</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 35.74</td>\r\n<td width=\"125\">BSR 2023 rates, DD0002</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"46\">D.1.5</td>\r\n<td width=\"381\">Providing &amp; fixing PrePainted Galvalume (PPGL) sheeting, including necessary accessories for fixing sheet(excluding the cost of purlins, rafter and trusses) - 25g</td>\r\n<td width=\"69\">26.41</td>\r\n<td>sq.m</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1,122.73</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp; 29,651.30</td>\r\n<td width=\"125\">Less by Nu. 303.55 than the BSR 2022 rates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"46\">D.1.6</td>\r\n<td width=\"381\">Providing &amp; fixing Pre - Painted Galvanised Iron (PPGI) sheets, including bolts, hooks and nuts 8mm dia. with bitumen and G.I limpet washers filled with white lead for connection, excluding the cost of purlins, rafter and trusses.-25g</td>\r\n<td width=\"69\">20.83</td>\r\n<td>sq.m</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1,354.89</td>\r\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp; 28,222.36</td>\r\n<td width=\"125\">Less by Nu. 54.75 BSR 2022 rates</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"46\">D.1.7</td>\r\n<td width=\"381\">Providing and fixing of masonry anchor fasteners (16mm dia x 12 inches length)</td>\r\n<td width=\"69\">33</td>\r\n<td>each</td>\r\n<td>